2026-06-06T19:10:17Z	Matt Reider	accepted	termkrush/Offline-BPM-detection-on-load.md	Pure-Rust onset-flux + autocorrelation detector (audio/bpm.rs): unit-tested within ±0.5 BPM across 90-174 on synthetic click tracks, stereo + mono, None on silence/too-short. Wired into the async load path (spawn_decode runs detect off-thread; place_decoded sets the deck BPM); deck panel displays it. CAVEAT: real-track accuracy vs *published* BPM is unverified (needs ground truth from the PM); the manual BPM nudge (,/.) corrects any miss and locks. Accepted on synthetic verification + wiring; revisit ±0.5-on-real-tracks when BPMs are provided.
