2026-06-06T19:46:22Z	Matt Reider	accepted	termkrush/More-clip-patterns-transformer-stutter-warble-and-reverse.md	Rounded out the pattern set on the same voice engine: Transformer (gate at a finer sixteenth division — faster chop than Cut), Stutter (loops a tiny div/2 slice — a roll), Warble (read rate wobbles ±30% sinusoidally — pitch vibrato), Reverse (plays the trimmed region backward). Pad ; now cycles all 7 (play/cut/scratch/xform/stutter/warble/reverse); cells label them. Tests: reverse plays a ramp high→low; stutter repeats its slice (frame 0 == frame 125); cycle rotates all 7. README/help updated. 135 lib + all suites green; fmt/clippy clean.
