2026-06-07T12:03:32Z	Matt Reider	accepted	termkrush/Pad-type-model-loop-scratch-or-one-shot.md	Pads carry a kind: OneShot (default) / Loop / Scratch. mix: PadKind enum + pad_kind array + cycle_pad_kind + pad_kind getter. TUI: ; cycles the focused pad's kind; the pad cell labels it (1shot/loop/scratch). Per-kind behaviour (loop repeat, scratch phrases) arrives in C4/Epic E. Tests: kind cycles+wraps (mix); ; cycles on the focused pad (tui). fmt + clippy --workspace + 8 suites green.
