2026-06-07T12:15:12Z	Matt Reider	accepted	termkrush/Master-tempo-from-the-first-loop.md	Master tempo seeded by the first loop. mix.master_bpm (Option<f32>) is set the first time a Loop-kind pad with a known BPM is triggered; one-shots don't seed it and later loops at other tempos don't change it (first loop wins). master_bpm() + set_master_bpm() (for manual/global-speed override). TUI header shows '♩ N BPM' once set. Test: one-shot doesn't seed, first loop sets 126, later 140 loop leaves it 126. green.
