2026-06-07T12:17:11Z	Matt Reider	accepted	termkrush/Sync-loop-pads-to-the-master-tempo-via-varispeed.md	Loops varispeed-sync to the master. SampleVoice reads at a fractional pos with a per-voice speed (linear interpolation); loop voices get speed = pad_bpm/master_bpm so beats lock to the grid (pitch rides, platter feel); one-shots play native (1.0). pad_play_speed() computes it at trigger. Test: a 100-BPM ramp loop under a 50-BPM master reads ~2x (output frame 25 ≈ source 50). fmt + clippy --workspace + 8 suites green.
