2026-06-07T12:27:17Z	Matt Reider	accepted	termkrush/Whip-and-wiki-scratch-primitives.md	Whip + wiki rubs. scratch::Stroke (from/to/gain/dur) + whip (push forward muted, pull back audible — the reverse swoosh) + wiki (forward+back both audible), built around the pad pivot. ScratchVoice walks a stroke list reading the clip (shared interp_frame); mixer sums scratch voices gated by pad gain + activation env; scratch_whip/scratch_wiki spawn them (~80ms rub). TUI: on a Scratch-kind pad, j = wiki, k = whip (else j=trigger, k=assign-rec). Tests: whip is silent on the forward stroke then sounds on the back; wiki sounds throughout; tui j/k spawn voices. fmt + clippy --workspace + 8 suites green.
